WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Move to the alphabet soup can, grasp it, and lift it off the table.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Move the alphabet soup can to the basket and release it inside.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Move to the tomato sauce can, grasp it, and lift it off the table.

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Move the tomato sauce can to the basket and release it inside.

